\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Dear Master, in whose life I see
\par All that, I would but fail to be,
\par Let Thy clear light ever shine,
\par To shame and guide this life of mine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Though what I dream and what I do
\par In my weak days are always two,
\par Help me, oppressed by things undone,
\par Thou, whose deeds and dreams were!
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

